{% comment %}
  Order annullerad (en-GB) — brandad för beavershop.co.uk.
  Klistras in i: Inställningar → Aviseringar → Kundaviseringar → Order annullerad → Redigera kod.
  Återbetalningsinfo är hämtad ur butikens Returns & cancellation-sida
  (beavershop.co.uk) 2026-08-23: automatiskt till ursprungligt betalsätt, inom
  10 arbetsdagar, kontakta support efter 15 arbetsdagar. Samma siffror som
  sidans "Refunds"-avsnitt. Ändras policyn, ändra här.
{% endcomment %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Your order's been cancelled</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f2f2f2; -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">

  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;">
    Your order's been cancelled — here's exactly what happens with your money.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px; width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e8e8e1;">

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background-color:#000000; padding:20px 24px;">
              <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;">
                <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:26px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#ffffff; text-transform:uppercase;">{{ shop.name }}</span>
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:36px 32px 8px 32px;" align="center">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:30px; line-height:1.15; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase;">Your order's been cancelled</span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:8px 32px 4px 32px;" align="center">
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#000000; margin:0;">
                {% if customer.first_name %}Hi {{ customer.first_name }}!{% else %}Hi there!{% endif %}
                Order <strong>{{ name }}</strong> has now been cancelled. Here's exactly what happens with your money.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Återbetalningsinfo — ur återbetalningspolicyn -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Your refund</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:4px 32px 20px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">1</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    If you've already paid, the money goes <strong>automatically back to the payment method you used</strong> — you don't need to do anything.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">2</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    The refund is made within <strong>10 working days</strong>. Your bank or card provider may need a day or two longer before it shows in your account.
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td width="34" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0;">
                    <div style="width:24px; height:24px; background:#dd1d1d; color:#ffffff; text-align:center; line-height:24px; font-family:'Anton',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px;">3</div>
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:8px 0; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000;">
                    Has it been more than <strong>15 working days</strong> without seeing the money? Email
                    <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#dd1d1d; font-weight:bold;">{{ shop.email }}</a> and we'll chase it up for you.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Avdelare -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px;"><div style="border-top:1px solid #e8e8e1; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div></td>
          </tr>

          <!-- FAQ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;">
              <span style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#000000; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Frequently asked questions</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 28px 32px;">
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:10px 0 0 0;"><strong>I cancelled by mistake — can the order be restored?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">The easiest way is to place a new order at <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color:#dd1d1d;">{{ shop.url | remove: 'https://' }}</a>. Not sure? Email us first.</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Will the money go back to the right card?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Yes — the refund always goes to exactly the same payment method the purchase was made with. It can't be redirected to a different account.</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#000000; margin:12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Any other questions?</strong></p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b6b6b; margin:2px 0 0 0;">Reply to this email or write to <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#dd1d1d;">{{ shop.email }}</a> — we'll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Sidfot -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background-color:#000000; padding:24px 32px;">
              <p style="font-family:'Anton','Arial Narrow',Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#ffffff; margin:0 0 8px 0; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;">{{ shop.name }}</p>
              <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#d9d9d9; margin:0;">
                Questions? Reply to this email or write to
                <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#ffffff;">{{ shop.email }}</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
